{
  "_comment": "Maps the free-text 'Your Role' answer of the team form to a group in team-config.json. Matching ignores case, accents, punctuation and '&'/'and'/'n'; a role is looked up whole first, then with qualifiers removed (head, co, coordinator, committee member for…), then split on commas, slashes and brackets; a small edit-distance fallback catches typos. Add an alias here to fix anything listed under 'needs review' in TODO-CONFIRM-team.md. `role` is only used by the first group (head | cohead); every other group shows its general label.",
